# Observed SHA-256 values for proprietary stock firmware inputs.
#
# These are the bytes actually seen in the local integration worktree on
# 2026-11-22. They are authenticity pins for the BUILD INPUTS, not approval of
# any generated image. The images themselves must never be committed to git.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <logical-input-name>   (sha256sum-compatible)
#
# r1_original.upt      stock HiBy R1 1.x OTA, 44,255,232 bytes
# r3proii_original.upt stock HiBy R3 Pro II OTA, 37,996,544 bytes
# v1.zip.part1/.part2  two byte-split pieces of the official TempoTec V1 1.3
#                      OTA zip, 18,191,074 bytes each
# v1.zip               the rejoined zip (informational; built by the prep script)
# v1_original.upt      the v1.upt extracted from that zip, 39,925,760 bytes

